            "desc": "Each bag contains a unique blend of the finest imported teas, including black and green teas, and other herbs. Our nutritional drinks for adults and kids impart a full-bodied, brisk flavor enjoyed for their greatly invigorating, thirst-quenching properties. The botanicals provide a natural way to satisfy hunger urges during weight loss or diet programs and do not affect the stomach or nerves adversely. ",
