            "desc": "Siberian Ginseng is the second most predominant ingredient in SPORTea®. This premium grade of Siberian Ginseng is considered an endurance builder, stamina enhancer, and recovery drink useful before, during, and after illness as an adaptogen and revitalizer. This is also the case for regular everyday workouts. Siberian Ginseng has also been found to be a stress reliever when used regularly throughout the day. SPORTea®'s Siberian Ginseng's adaptogenic qualities allow it to combat daily stress and the physical manifestations of the strains of everyday living that cause muscle strain, headaches, and body aches. The energy provided by Siberian Ginseng is a sustaining energy without the letdowns that are typically associated with traditional heavy caffeine and/or sugary beverages.",
