          "type": "properties",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ginger",
            "desc": "Ginger enhances blood flow and promotes better circulation. It is slightly sweet, has a delightful aroma, and a warming, soothing action. Ginger minimizes the discomfort associated with colds and flu such as headaches, tense muscles, and stomach pain. Ginger is also frequently taken to counteract the effects of alcohol consumption and office burnout due to fatigue.",
