        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "heading": "Unique Herbal Components",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>We've carefully selected unique herbal components for SPORTea® blend to provide natural stress relief and immune support. Our formula includes citrus elements rich in vitamin C, which acts as a powerful antioxidant and supports electrolyte balance. These herbal ingredients work synergistically to create a refreshing and functional beverage that complements an active lifestyle:</p>",
        "after_images_description": "",
        "after_description": "<h2>The Role of Caffeine in SPORTea®</h2><p>We've carefully crafted the caffeine content in SPORTea® to be less than or equivalent to a decaffeinated cup of coffee. Why? We have optimized the ingredients to provide a natural energy boost without the jitters often associated with high-caffeine and high-sugar energy drinks.</p><p>Our combination of ingredients creates a refreshing beverage that delivers sustained energy supporting an active lifestyle without relying on artificial stimulants that attack the central nervous system.</p>",
