    "product_highlight_gQGXBH": {
      "type": "product-highlight",
      "settings": {
        "show_table": false,
        "table1": "Herbal Component",
        "table2": "Herbal Component",
        "table3": "Herbal Component",
        "background": "#ffffff",
        "list_size": 24,
        "text_color": "#000000",
        "heading": "Benefits of Individual SPORTea® Ingredients",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>We've carefully selected each ingredient in SPORTea® for its unique benefits. Our blend features green tea's antioxidant properties, herbal components that aid hydration during exercise and energy-boosting elements like lemon. These ingredients work together to create a refreshing drink that supports alertness and overall well-being. Let's explore how each component contributes to SPORTea® effectiveness.</p><h4>Antioxidant Properties of Green Tea</h4><p>We've incorporated green tea into our SPORTea® blend for its powerful antioxidant properties. These antioxidants, particularly catechins, help protect our cells from oxidative stress and support overall health. By combining green tea with ginseng, we've created a synergistic effect that enhances the drink's ability to boost energy and mental clarity while providing essential nutrients.</p><h4>Hydration Benefits of Herbal Ingredients</h4><p>We've carefully selected herbal ingredients in SPORTea® that offer excellent hydration benefits. Our blend includes ginger root, which not only enhances flavor but also supports electrolyte balance. These natural components work together to help replenish fluids lost during physical activity, making SPORTea® an ideal choice for staying hydrated during workouts or on hot days.</p><h4>Energy Boosting Effects of Select Ingredients</h4><p>We've carefully selected energy-boosting ingredients for SPORTea® to provide natural vitality without artificial stimulants. Our formula includes Brazilian mate, known for its sustained energy-enhancing properties, and Siberian ginseng, which supports physical endurance. These components work synergistically with green tea to offer a balanced energy lift, making SPORTea® an excellent choice for maintaining alertness during workouts or busy days.</p>",
        "after_images_description": "",
        "after_description": "",
        "button_text": "Shop Now",
        "button_link": ""
      }
