        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "heading": "How to Read SPORTea® Ingredient Labels",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>We'll guide you through reading SPORTea® ingredient labels to ensure you understand what's in your drink. We'll cover decoding ingredient lists, identifying quality sources, and spotting additives. Our insights will help you make informed choices about the SPORTea® products you consume, aligning with your health and wellness goals.</p>",
        "after_images_description": "<h4>Understanding Ingredient Lists</h4><p>We prioritize transparency in our ingredient labels, listing components in descending order by weight. Our SPORTea® blend features a mix of teas, herbs, and natural flavors, each contributing to the drink's unique taste and benefits. We encourage our customers to familiarize themselves with common ingredient names and their functions to make informed choices about their beverage consumption.</p><h4>Identifying Quality and Sourcing</h4><p>We source our ingredients from reputable suppliers who meet our strict quality standards. Our team carefully selects each component, ensuring it contributes to the overall benefits and flavor profile of SPORTea®. We prioritize natural and sustainably sourced ingredients whenever possible, reflecting our commitment to both quality and environmental responsibility.</p><h4>Spotting Additives and Preservatives<br/></h4><p>We take pride in crafting SPORTea® without unnecessary additives or preservatives. Our ingredient list is transparent, featuring only natural components that contribute to flavor, nutrition, and functionality. When examining our labels, you'll notice the absence of artificial sweeteners, colors, or preservatives. We achieve this by using high-quality, shelf-stable ingredients and careful processing methods. To help you understand our commitment to clean ingredients, we've created a table highlighting common additives and their status in SPORTea®:</p>",
