        "background": "#264786",
        "list_size": 24,
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "heading": "Spotting Additives and Preservatives",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>We address common queries about SPORTea® ingredients, focusing on safety, customization options, and comparisons with other beverages. Our responses provide clear information on ingredient safety measures, personalization possibilities, and how SPORTea® components stack up against alternatives. These insights help you make informed decisions about incorporating SPORTea® into your lifestyle.<br/></p><h4>Are SPORTea® Ingredients Safe?</h4><p>We prioritize the safety of our SPORTea® ingredients, sourcing them from reputable suppliers and conducting rigorous quality control tests. Our blend contains only natural components that have been extensively studied for their health benefits and safety profiles. We carefully monitor the caffeine content to ensure it remains the equivalent of a decaffeinated cup of coffee. Our commitment to transparency means we clearly list all ingredients on our packaging, allowing customers to make informed decisions about their consumption:<br/></p><ul><li>Source ingredients from trusted suppliers</li><li>Conduct thorough quality control tests</li><li>Use only natural, well-studied components</li><li>Monitor caffeine content for safety (aiming for low caffeine content, similar to decaf coffee)</li><li>Provide clear ingredient lists on packaging</li></ul><p></p><h4>How Do SPORTea® Ingredients Compare to Other Beverages?</h4><p>We've carefully formulated SPORTea® to offer unique benefits compared to other beverages. Our blend contains natural energy sources like green tea and yerba mate, providing sustained energy without the crash associated with sugary energy drinks. Unlike many sports drinks, SPORTea® is free from artificial colors (like Red 40, Blue 1, and Yellow 5 found in some Gatorade flavors) and flavors (such as sugar), relying instead on natural herbal ingredients that support hydration and recovery. We've also ensured that SPORTea® has a lower calorie content than most sweetened beverages, making it an excellent choice for health-conscious individuals seeking a refreshing and functional drink.</p>",
        "after_images_description": "",
        "after_description": "",
